# The worker image COPYs src/vivijure_backend, deploy/requirements.txt + the deploy/*.py helpers, and
# the staged bake seed bins. Keep the rest of the context out (fast uploads, no secrets/stray weights
# leaking into a layer).
.git
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
tests
scripts
_smoke
*.md
.gitignore
Jenkinsfile
.pytest_cache
*.safetensors
*.png
*.mp4
*.tar.gz

# Bake seed bins: CI (the release workflow) stages the curated, precision-selected weight seed and
# bin-packs it under deploy/seed-bins/. The per-bin COPY layers need these files IN the build context,
# so re-include them AFTER the global weight/image excludes above (last match wins in .dockerignore).
!deploy/seed-bins
!deploy/seed-bins/**
